  "sourceTitle": "oMLX vs Rapid-MLX vs Splash vs MTPLX on M3 Max 36 GB: 110 tok/s on Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, ~32 tok/s on Qwen3.8-27B",
  "sourceBodyHash": "89e8fe5f12f96bc17568cbf8aa777fe0be83e2c92b85d6c1535faa8703deff65",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
